        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchadagi '-gani uchun' yoki '... ekan, ...' ga mos: 'Dam olish kuni EKAN, oldindan band qiling' = 주말이니까 미리 예약하세요.",
      "compare_en": "Like English 'since / because' — 'Since it's the weekend, book ahead' = 주말이니까 미리 예약하세요. Unlike -아서/어서, it works before requests and suggestions."
